{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00850","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 武功舞歌二首 二 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 武功舞歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿算超前古，神功格上圆。\n百川留禹迹，万国戴尧天。\n既已櫜弓矢，诚宜播管弦。\n跄跄随鸟兽，共乐太平年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}